title: Aruba Central: Access Point Memory
agents: linux, windows
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Memory usage of an Aruba access point. Aruba Central reports total and
 free memory as strings such as {920.39 MB}; the check derives the used
 memory from both values.

 The default levels are 80%/90% of the total memory and can be changed
 with the rule "Aruba access point memory".

perfdata:
 Two values: the used memory in percent and in bytes.

inventory:
 One service per access point that reports its memory.
